{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/15279-hiit-me-with-a-good-european-city-to-start-with-in-mummy","id":15279,"title":"Hiit me With a good European city to start with in Mummy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-21T03:37:03-08:00","id":15279,"title":"Hiit me With a good European city to start with in Mummy","content":"Soon, I'm starting up a short Mummy campaign that's going last until summer. And I have not decided yet where to place it. I am not going to use the US, very tired of prewritten WoD games over there. So Europe for me then (I were thinking of maybe Africa or Asia, but need to read a bit more up on a few countries before that is going to happen).<br /> <br /> The story will be around 4 (maaaaybe 5) Mummies all being abruptly awaken by someone who have stolen a very important artefact from each of them - at the exact same time. So I need to probably use a capitol city or larger to have that many mummies contained within the city - cult's and all.<br /> <br /> So sell me a city - I am not looking for special themes of a city yet, just for maybe something new and exciting. The last cities I've been using in roleplaying games have been Moskva and London, so they both are out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1159-kjetilkverndokken","name":"kjetilkverndokken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1159_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-21T03:51:24-08:00","id":15282,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Catacombs_of_Paris\" target=\"_blank\">Paris</a><br /> <br 